@host = http://localhost:8080

GET {{host}}/api/health

### Ask your memory
POST {{host}}/api/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "Where are my keys?" }

### Guardian status
GET {{host}}/api/guardian/status

### Forget the last hour (privacy)
POST {{host}}/api/memory/forget
Content-Type: application/json

{ "minutes": 60 }
